{
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "schema": "commands/defaults",
  "_doc": "Factory training-command (velocity-template) registry. The 11 entries below are shipped with UnitPort as a default catalog of trainable behavior patterns: 4 minimal Python-equivalent items (stand/walk/turn/pace) + 7 directional items (forward_slow/forward_fast/backward/strafe_left/strafe_right/turn_left/turn_right). Source: DEMO/src/system/training/training_item_registry.py + DEMO/custom_mods/training/training_items.yaml. User-side overlay lives at ~/UnitPort/registers/commands_custom.json (merged on load via registers.commands.merge_user_extensions).",
